sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Titulaire
    participant NG as Angular (SPA)
    participant API as Django / DRF
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>NG: saisit e-mail + mot de passe
    NG->>API: POST /api/token/ { email, password }
    API->>DB: vérifie l'identité (hash PBKDF2)
    DB-->>API: OK
    API-->>NG: 200 { access } + Set-Cookie: refresh_token (HttpOnly, Strict, Secure)
    Note over API,NG: cookie session_info (non-HttpOnly) : auth_type + permissions
    NG->>NG: garde le jeton d'accès EN MÉMOIRE
    NG-->>U: redirection vers returnUrl ou /dashboard

    rect rgb(240,248,240)
    Note over NG,API: Requête métier ultérieure
    NG->>API: GET /api/... (Authorization: Bearer access)
    API->>API: JWTAuthentication -> IsAuthenticated [-> HasPaidAccess]
    API-->>NG: 200 données (filtrées pharmacy = request.user)
